							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Our hearts go out to the people that fell victim to the horrible tragedy that happened this morning. We hope they find the persons involved to bring justice.
							<br>
							 - Anumatu<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=169">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
